<title>FRANCE: Block of 0.92 pct of Scor traded.</title>
<headline>Block of 0.92 pct of Scor traded.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-08-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>A block of 250,000 shares in Scor, representing 0.92 percent of the reinsurer's capital, was traded on Friday morning at 208 francs, market operators said.</p>
<p>Shares in Scor were up 4.90 francs at 208.90 at 1100 GMT in volume of 454,253 shares.</p>
<p>Insurance group Axa on Friday said it sold its 9.7 percent stake in Scor, generating a net capital gain of 22.5 million francs.</p>
</text>
